      <h1>Recurrent Neural Networks &amp; <span class="accent">LSTMs</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">Master sequence modeling with RNNs and LSTMs. Learn how to process variable-length sequences, handle long-term dependencies, and build state-of-the-art models for time series, language, and sequential data.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="objectives">
      <h4>Learning Objectives</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>Understand the architecture and mechanics of vanilla RNNs</li>
        <li>Learn why LSTMs solve the vanishing gradient problem</li>
